  "description": "Love is blind and Noh Yun-ha was once a victim. For the sake of her first love, she even decided to drop out of college and leave her dream as a fashion designer. Then, did everything end well? Of course not. The love he believed in betrayed him. However, Yun-ha didn't want to dwell on sorrow. Her dream to beautify the appearance of the crowd through the clothes she makes has not been extinguished and she is ready to start everything from scratch. With the help of an acquaintance from college in a tougher fashion industry than she ever imagined, will Noh Yun-ha be able to make her dream come true?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://page.kakao.com/content/55585302)",
